---
import StatePage from '../../layouts/StatePage.astro';
---
<StatePage
  title="Privacy Policy — SmallEstateForm.com"
  description="Privacy Policy for SmallEstateForm.com. Learn how we handle your information when you use our estate document generator."
  canonicalUrl="https://smallestateform.com/privacy-policy/"
>
  <section style="padding:4rem 1.5rem;background:#F7F4EF;border-bottom:1px solid #D4CCC0;">
    <div style="max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;">
      <p style="font-size:0.8rem;color:#6B6560;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">
        <a href="/" style="color:#8B6914;text-decoration:none;">Home</a> › Privacy Policy
      </p>
      <h1 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,2.8rem);color:#2C2C2A;margin-bottom:1rem;">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:0.875rem;color:#6B6560;">Last updated: July 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding:3rem 1.5rem;">
    <div style="max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;color:#2C2C2A;line-height:1.75;">

      <h2 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:1.5rem;margin:2rem 0 0.75rem;color:#2C2C2A;">Overview</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">SmallEstateForm.com ("we," "us," or "our") is committed to protecting your privacy. This policy explains how we collect, use, and protect information when you use our estate document generator.</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;background:#EEF4E8;border-left:3px solid #2D5016;padding:1rem 1.25rem;font-size:0.9rem;"><strong>The short version:</strong> We generate documents locally in your browser. Your personal details (deceased's name, heir information, asset descriptions) are never uploaded to our servers or stored by us. PDF generation happens entirely in your browser using JavaScript.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:1.5rem;margin:2rem 0 0.75rem;color:#2C2C2A;">Information We Do Not Collect</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;">When you use the document generator, the following information is processed <strong>only in your browser</strong> and is never sent to our servers:</p>
      <ul style="margin-left:1.5rem;margin-bottom:1rem;color:#6B6560;">
        <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">The name of the deceased person</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Heir names, relationships, and contact details</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Asset descriptions, property addresses, and financial information</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Dates of death and other estate details</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Generated PDF documents</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:1.5rem;margin:2rem 0 0.75rem;color:#2C2C2A;">Information We May Collect</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Like most websites, we may collect basic technical information through standard server logs and analytics:</p>
      <ul style="margin-left:1.5rem;margin-bottom:1rem;color:#6B6560;">
        <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;"><strong>Usage data:</strong> Pages visited, time on site, browser type, device type</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;"><strong>IP addresses:</strong> Collected by our hosting provider (Vercel) for security and performance</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;"><strong>Contact form submissions:</strong> If you contact us via the contact form, we receive your name, email address, and message</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:1.5rem;margin:2rem 0 0.75rem;color:#2C2C2A;">How We Use Information</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">We use the limited information we collect solely to: operate and improve the website, respond to contact form inquiries, and monitor for security issues. We do not sell, trade, or share your information with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:1.5rem;margin:2rem 0 0.75rem;color:#2C2C2A;">Cookies</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">SmallEstateForm.com uses minimal cookies. We do not use advertising cookies or tracking pixels. Our hosting provider (Vercel) may set performance cookies. You can disable cookies in your browser settings without affecting your ability to generate documents.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:1.5rem;margin:2rem 0 0.75rem;color:#2C2C2A;">Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">We use the following third-party services:</p>
      <ul style="margin-left:1.5rem;margin-bottom:1rem;color:#6B6560;">
        <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;"><strong>Vercel</strong> — website hosting. <a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy" style="color:#8B6914;">Vercel Privacy Policy</a></li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;"><strong>Google Fonts</strong> — font delivery. <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" style="color:#8B6914;">Google Privacy Policy</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">After the beta period, when payments are enabled, we will use Dodo Payments to process transactions. Payment data is handled entirely by the payment processor and is never stored on our servers.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:1.5rem;margin:2rem 0 0.75rem;color:#2C2C2A;">Your Rights</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Because we do not store your estate document data, there is nothing to request, delete, or export. If you submitted a contact form inquiry and want it removed from our records, email us at <a href="mailto:contact@smallestateform.com" style="color:#8B6914;">contact@smallestateform.com</a>.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:1.5rem;margin:2rem 0 0.75rem;color:#2C2C2A;">Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The date at the top of this page reflects when it was last updated. Continued use of the site after any changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:1.5rem;margin:2rem 0 0.75rem;color:#2C2C2A;">Contact</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Questions about this Privacy Policy? <a href="/contact/" style="color:#8B6914;">Contact us here</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</StatePage>
